        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 119.37,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "to solve because you need to do a lot of testing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "You know, if you heard about this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "whenever you make an application,",
